  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"primary\"> <article id=\"post-1065249\"><div><div><div><p><img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a488ada52047068f06752b421e04ab555e22cdfaf7b7f4a25d14b595874694af?s=300&amp;r=g&amp;d=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F12%2Fnasainsigniargb150px.png\" alt=\"Profile image for HQ Web Team\"></p><p>HQ Web Team</p></div><p><span>Nov 17, 2026</span></p>\n</div><div>\n<p>NASA astronaut Anil Menon took this selfie during a spacewalk on Oct. 29, 2026. He and CSA (Canadian Space Agency) astronaut Joshua Kutryk installed a new roll-out solar array on the International Space Station.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/blogs/spacestation/\">Get daily updates from the space station.</a></p>\n<p><em>Image credit: NASA/Anil Menon</em></p>\n</div></div></article>\n</div></div>",
